sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant API as Backend API (Express)
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant PP as PayPal

    C->>FE: Add item to cart
    FE->>API: POST /api/cart
    API->>DB: Create/update cart
    DB-->>API: Cart document
    API-->>FE: Updated cart

    C->>FE: Proceed to checkout
    FE->>API: POST /api/checkout
    API->>DB: Create checkout session (Pending)
    DB-->>API: Checkout session
    API-->>FE: Checkout session payload

    FE->>PP: Create + capture payment
    PP-->>FE: paymentDetails
    FE->>API: PUT /api/checkout/:id/pay
    API->>DB: Mark checkout isPaid=true
    DB-->>API: Paid checkout
    API-->>FE: Payment confirmed

    FE->>API: POST /api/checkout/:id/finalize
    API->>DB: Create Order from Checkout
    API->>DB: Mark checkout isFinalized=true
    API->>DB: Delete user cart
    DB-->>API: Final order
    API-->>FE: Finalized order response
